{
  "id": "agenticFixVelocityDashboard",
  "type": "dashboard-widget",
  "layout": [
    {
      "height": 420,
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "velocityIntro",
          "size": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "height": 400,
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "sdCreatedMonth",
          "size": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "sdResolvedMonth",
          "size": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "sdAvgHandling",
          "size": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "sdOpenIssues",
          "size": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "height": 400,
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "aikidoOpen",
          "size": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "aikidoFixed",
          "size": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "avgPrCycleTime",
          "size": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "deploysMonth",
          "size": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "height": 420,
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "issueFlowTrend",
          "size": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "height": 420,
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "prLeadTimeTrend",
          "size": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "height": 400,
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "sdStatusPie",
          "size": 6
        },
        {
          "id": "aikidoStatusPie",
          "size": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "height": 520,
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "sdIssuesTable",
          "size": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "height": 520,
      "columns": [
        {
          "id": "aikidoTable",
          "size": 12
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": "velocityIntro",
      "type": "markdown",
      "title": "Discovery \u2192 Fix velocity",
      "icon": "Docs",
      "source": "custom",
      "markdown": "## Agentic fix velocity (DORA-aligned)\n\nTracks how fast issues move from **discovery** (Aikido / Jira SD create) to **fix** (Cursor PR + Done).\n\n| Signal on this page | Closest DORA metric | Elite target (DORA) |\n|---|---|---|\n| SD issues created / resolved (month) | **Throughput** (supports Deployment Frequency) | Daily change cadence |\n| Avg issue handling duration | **MTTR** proxy for defects | < 1 hour (Elite) / < 1 day (High) |\n| Merged PR cycle time | **Lead Time for Changes** | < 24 hours |\n| Successful deployments (month) | **Deployment Frequency** | \u2265 1/day (Elite) |\n\nPipeline: `Aikido vuln \u2192 SD ticket \u2192 Cursor triage/fix \u2192 PR merge \u2192 Jira Done`"
    },
    {
      "id": "sdCreatedMonth",
      "type": "entities-number-chart",
      "title": "SD issues created (30d)",
      "icon": "Jira",
      "description": "Jira SD issues created in the last month \u2014 discovery / intake volume",
      "unit": "none",
      "chartType": "countEntities",
      "blueprint": "jiraIssue",
      "dataset": {
        "combinator": "and",
        "rules": [
          {
            "operator": "relatedTo",
            "blueprint": "jiraProject",
            "value": "SD"
          },
          {
            "property": "created",
            "operator": "between",
            "value": {
              "preset": "lastMonth"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "func": "count"
    },
    {
      "id": "sdResolvedMonth",
      "type": "entities-number-chart",
      "title": "SD issues resolved (30d)",
      "icon": "Jira",
      "description": "Jira SD issues with a resolution date in the last month \u2014 fix throughput",
      "unit": "none",
      "chartType": "countEntities",
      "blueprint": "jiraIssue",
      "dataset": {
        "combinator": "and",
        "rules": [
          {
            "operator": "relatedTo",
            "blueprint": "jiraProject",
            "value": "SD"
          },
          {
            "property": "resolutionDate",
            "operator": "between",
            "value": {
              "preset": "lastMonth"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "func": "count"
    },
    {
      "id": "sdAvgHandling",
      "type": "entities-number-chart",
      "title": "Avg handling duration",
      "icon": "Clock",
      "description": "Average days from create to resolve for SD issues resolved in the last month (DORA MTTR-style recovery for defects). Elite \u2248 <1 day.",
      "unit": "custom",
      "conditionalFormatting": [
        {
          "operator": "<=",
          "value": 1,
          "message": "Elite / High",
          "color": "green"
        },
        {
          "operator": "<=",
          "value": 7,
          "message": "Medium",
          "color": "yellow"
        },
        {
          "operator": ">",
          "value": 7,
          "message": "Low",
          "color": "red"
        }
      ],
      "displayFormatting": "custom",
      "decimalPlaces": ".00",
      "chartType": "aggregateByProperty",
      "blueprint": "jiraIssue",
      "calculationBy": "property",
      "dataset": {
        "combinator": "and",
        "rules": [
          {
            "operator": "relatedTo",
            "blueprint": "jiraProject",
            "value": "SD"
          },
          {
            "property": "resolutionDate",
            "operator": "between",
            "value": {
              "preset": "lastMonth"
            }
          },
          {
            "operator": "isNotEmpty",
            "property": "handlingDuration"
          }
        ]
      },
      "property": "handlingDuration",
      "func": "average",
      "averageOf": "total",
      "unitCustom": "days"
    },
    {
      "id": "sdOpenIssues",
      "type": "entities-number-chart",
      "title": "Open SD issues",
      "icon": "Alert",
      "description": "SD issues not yet Done \u2014 remaining work in the fix pipeline",
      "unit": "none",
      "chartType": "countEntities",
      "blueprint": "jiraIssue",
      "dataset": {
        "combinator": "and",
        "rules": [
          {
            "operator": "relatedTo",
            "blueprint": "jiraProject",
            "value": "SD"
          },
          {
            "property": "status",
            "operator": "!=",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        ]
      },
      "func": "count"
    },
    {
      "id": "aikidoOpen",
      "type": "entities-number-chart",
      "title": "Open Aikido vulns",
      "icon": "Vulnerability",
      "description": "Aikido vulnerabilities still Open or In Progress \u2014 discovery backlog",
      "unit": "none",
      "chartType": "countEntities",
      "blueprint": "aikidoVulnerability",
      "dataset": {
        "combinator": "or",
        "rules": [
          {
            "property": "status",
            "operator": "=",
            "value": "Open"
          },
          {
            "property": "status",
            "operator": "=",
            "value": "In Progress"
          }
        ]
      },
      "func": "count"
    },
    {
      "id": "aikidoFixed",
      "type": "entities-number-chart",
      "title": "Fixed Aikido vulns",
      "icon": "Vulnerability",
      "description": "Aikido vulnerabilities marked Fixed",
      "unit": "none",
      "chartType": "countEntities",
      "blueprint": "aikidoVulnerability",
      "dataset": {
        "combinator": "and",
        "rules": [
          {
            "property": "status",
            "operator": "=",
            "value": "Fixed"
          }
        ]
      },
      "func": "count"
    },
    {
      "id": "avgPrCycleTime",
      "type": "entities-number-chart",
      "title": "Avg PR cycle time",
      "icon": "Github",
      "description": "Average cycle time (hours) for PRs merged in the last month \u2014 DORA Lead Time for Changes proxy",
      "unit": "custom",
      "conditionalFormatting": [
        {
          "operator": "<=",
          "value": 24,
          "message": "Elite (<24h)",
          "color": "green"
        },
        {
          "operator": "<=",
          "value": 168,
          "message": "High (<1w)",
          "color": "yellow"
        },
        {
          "operator": ">",
          "value": 168,
          "message": "Medium/Low",
          "color": "orange"
        }
      ],
      "displayFormatting": "custom",
      "decimalPlaces": ".00",
      "chartType": "aggregateByProperty",
      "blueprint": "githubPullRequest",
      "calculationBy": "property",
      "dataset": {
        "combinator": "and",
        "rules": [
          {
            "property": "status",
            "operator": "=",
            "value": "merged"
          },
          {
            "property": "mergedAt",
            "operator": "between",
            "value": {
              "preset": "lastMonth"
            }
          },
          {
            "operator": "isNotEmpty",
            "property": "cycle_time_hours"
          }
        ]
      },
      "property": "cycle_time_hours",
      "func": "average",
      "averageOf": "total",
      "unitCustom": "hours"
    },
    {
      "id": "deploysMonth",
      "type": "entities-number-chart",
      "title": "Successful deploys (30d)",
      "icon": "Deployment",
      "description": "Successful production-tracked deployments in the last month \u2014 DORA Deployment Frequency volume",
      "unit": "none",
      "chartType": "countEntities",
      "blueprint": "deployment",
      "dataset": {
        "combinator": "and",
        "rules": [
          {
            "property": "deploymentStatus",
            "operator": "=",
            "value": "Success"
          },
          {
            "property": "createdAt",
            "operator": "between",
            "value": {
              "preset": "lastMonth"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "func": "count"
    },
    {
      "id": "issueFlowTrend",
      "type": "multi-line-chart",
      "icon": "LineChart",
      "title": "Issue flow \u2014 created vs resolved",
      "xAxisTitle": "Day",
      "yAxisTitle": "Issues",
      "timeInterval": "day",
      "timeRange": {
        "preset": "lastMonth"
      },
      "description": "Daily SD issue create and resolve volume over the last month",
      "lines": [
        {
          "title": "Created",
          "blueprint": "jiraIssue",
          "chartType": "countEntities",
          "func": "count",
          "measureTimeBy": "created",
          "dataset": {
            "combinator": "and",
            "rules": [
              {
                "operator": "relatedTo",
                "blueprint": "jiraProject",
                "value": "SD"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "title": "Resolved",
          "blueprint": "jiraIssue",
          "chartType": "countEntities",
          "func": "count",
          "measureTimeBy": "resolutionDate",
          "dataset": {
            "combinator": "and",
            "rules": [
              {
                "operator": "relatedTo",
                "blueprint": "jiraProject",
                "value": "SD"
              },
              {
                "operator": "isNotEmpty",
                "property": "resolutionDate"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "baselines": []
    },
    {
      "id": "prLeadTimeTrend",
      "type": "multi-line-chart",
      "icon": "LineChart",
      "title": "Lead time trend \u2014 PR cycle hours",
      "xAxisTitle": "Day",
      "yAxisTitle": "Hours",
      "timeInterval": "day",
      "timeRange": {
        "preset": "lastMonth"
      },
      "description": "Daily average PR cycle time for merged PRs (DORA Lead Time for Changes)",
      "lines": [
        {
          "title": "Avg cycle time (h)",
          "blueprint": "githubPullRequest",
          "chartType": "aggregatePropertiesValues",
          "properties": [
            "properties.cycle_time_hours"
          ],
          "func": "average",
          "measureTimeBy": "mergedAt",
          "dataset": {
            "combinator": "and",
            "rules": [
              {
                "property": "status",
                "operator": "=",
                "value": "merged"
              },
              {
                "operator": "isNotEmpty",
                "property": "cycle_time_hours"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "baselines": [
        {
          "name": "Elite (<24h)",
          "value": 24,
          "color": "green"
        },
        {
          "name": "High (<168h)",
          "value": 168,
          "color": "yellow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sdStatusPie",
      "type": "entities-pie-chart",
      "icon": "Pie",
      "title": "SD issues by status",
      "blueprint": "jiraIssue",
      "property": "property#status",
      "description": "Current status mix for Jira project SD",
      "dataset": {
        "combinator": "and",
        "rules": [
          {
            "operator": "relatedTo",
            "blueprint": "jiraProject",
            "value": "SD"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "aikidoStatusPie",
      "type": "entities-pie-chart",
      "icon": "Pie",
      "title": "Aikido vulns by status",
      "blueprint": "aikidoVulnerability",
      "property": "property#status",
      "description": "Discovery backlog vs fixed vulnerabilities",
      "dataset": {
        "combinator": "and",
        "rules": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sdIssuesTable",
      "type": "table-entities-explorer",
      "icon": "Table",
      "description": "Jira SD issues with create/resolve timestamps and handling duration (days)",
      "title": "SD issues \u2014 handling time",
      "blueprint": "jiraIssue",
      "dataset": {
        "combinator": "and",
        "rules": [
          {
            "operator": "relatedTo",
            "blueprint": "jiraProject",
            "value": "SD"
          }
        ]
      },
      "excludedFields": [],
      "displayMode": "widget",
      "blueprintConfig": {
        "jiraIssue": {
          "groupSettings": {
            "groupBy": [
              "status"
            ]
          },
          "sortSettings": {
            "sortBy": [
              {
                "property": "created",
                "order": "desc"
              }
            ]
          },
          "propertiesSettings": {
            "order": [
              "$title",
              "status",
              "priority",
              "issueType",
              "created",
              "resolutionDate",
              "handlingDuration",
              "service",
              "url"
            ],
            "shown": [
              "$title",
              "status",
              "priority",
              "issueType",
              "created",
              "resolutionDate",
              "handlingDuration",
              "service",
              "url"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "aikidoTable",
      "type": "table-entities-explorer",
      "icon": "Table",
      "description": "Discovered vulnerabilities feeding the agentic triage \u2192 Jira path",
      "title": "Aikido vulnerabilities",
      "blueprint": "aikidoVulnerability",
      "dataset": {
        "combinator": "and",
        "rules": []
      },
      "excludedFields": [],
      "displayMode": "widget",
      "blueprintConfig": {
        "aikidoVulnerability": {
          "groupSettings": {
            "groupBy": [
              "status"
            ]
          },
          "sortSettings": {
            "sortBy": [
              {
                "property": "discovered_at",
                "order": "desc"
              }
            ]
          },
          "propertiesSettings": {
            "order": [
              "$title",
              "severity",
              "status",
              "cve_id",
              "discovered_at",
              "service",
              "affected_package",
              "fixed_version"
            ],
            "shown": [
              "$title",
              "severity",
              "status",
              "cve_id",
              "discovered_at",
              "service",
              "affected_package",
              "fixed_version"
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
